%% Title: ChEMBL Activity Extraction To Bronze Artifact Publication
%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date    2026-05-12
%% @type    sequenceDiagram
%% @level   Provider / Interaction
%% RULES: RULES.md §2.1, §4.1, ADR-014
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Runner as PipelineRunner
    participant Exec as BatchExecutor
    participant Adapter as ChemblAdapter
    participant HTTP as UnifiedHTTPClient
    participant Rate as TokenBucketRateLimiter
    participant Bronze as BronzeWriter
    participant Meta as MetadataWriter

    Runner->>Exec: execute batch loop
    Exec->>Adapter: fetch activity records
    Adapter->>Rate: try_acquire()
    Rate-->>Adapter: token granted
    Adapter->>HTTP: GET /activity + filters
    HTTP-->>Adapter: ChEMBL payload
    Adapter-->>Exec: mapped raw records
    Exec->>Bronze: write raw batch artifact
    Bronze-->>Exec: BronzeWriteResult
    Exec->>Meta: persist bronze metadata
    Meta-->>Exec: metadata path + dataset_ref
    Exec-->>Runner: batch written with batch_id

    Note over Adapter,Bronze: The focused slice ends at bronze publication, before silver normalization or gold validation.
